 "sections": [
  {
   "heading": "Everyday objects",
   "body": "Around the house and in your bag: *le téléphone* (phone), *les clés* (keys), *le portefeuille* (wallet), *la montre* (watch), *les lunettes* (glasses — always plural), *le parapluie* (umbrella), *le cahier* (notebook), *le crayon* (pencil), *la lampe*, *le miroir*, *la bouteille* (bottle), *le verre* (glass), *la tasse* (cup)."
  },
  {
   "heading": "Colours",
   "body": "Colours are adjectives: they go **after** the noun and agree like other adjectives.\n\n*un sac noir, une montre noire, des lunettes noires, des chaussures marron*. To ask: *Il est de quelle couleur ?* (What colour is it?)",
